  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If you fail a saving throw, you can reroll it with a bonus equal to your Fighter level (currently, [[lookup @classes.fighter.levels]]). You must use the new roll, and you can't use this feature again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>You can use this feature twice before a Long Rest starting at level 13 and three times before a Long Rest starting at level 17.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-eVLmL8YfOocgD4rC\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature's maximum usages scale automatically as you level up.</p></section>",
